# Testing Definition Rules

- Any payment-flow change requires tests in the same task.
- Cover positive and negative cases for auth, status changes, and callbacks.
- Add contract tests for DTO shape and `ErrorDetails` format.
- Add idempotency tests for duplicate webhook delivery.
- Add regression tests for edge amounts (min/max, underpaid/overpaid) where relevant.
- For bug fixes, add a failing test first when practical.
- Do not mark work complete if critical-path tests are missing or skipped without rationale.
